caption: GATES Setting Rules — Authority and Scope
technology-rule: authority-and-scope

This document is the canonical cybernetics framework for technology native to the GATES setting. Other worlds and other GMs in the wider Isekai campaign may use different cybernetics rules. Their technologies should be evaluated using their own world's established rules unless they are imported, reverse-engineered, or rebuilt under GATES technology.
